# Fastlane env vars (replace with real paths)
# SUPPLY_JSON_KEY is provided by the Makefile as an absolute path derived from
# the repo location, so it keeps working wherever the checkout lives. It was
# hardcoded here to a ~/Downloads path that stopped existing when the project
# moved, and fastlane loads this file over the Makefile's value — so the stale
# path won and the deploy failed. Only set it here to override deliberately.
# SUPPLY_JSON_KEY=/absolute/path/to/play.json
# You can also include the signing vars here if you prefer
PK_KEYSTORE_PATH=../app-signing/apk-signing.jks
PK_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=your_keystore_password
PK_KEY_ALIAS=pk_upload
PK_KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password
